    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hit &amp; Haunted</strong> is a murder mystery investigation game, except you\u2019re not a detective. Instead, you play as two characters: <strong>Eli</strong>, the ghost of the victim; and <strong>Ace</strong>, the hitman who killed him. This unlikely duo must work together to find the anonymous client who hired the hit so that Eli can move on to the afterlife, and more importantly, <i>stop haunting Ace</i>. (This is made a bit more difficult by the fact that Eli doesn\u2019t remember much about his life, because, you know, Ace shot him in the head.)</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between Ace and Eli to use their different abilities. Ace is able to interact with other living humans and objects in the living world, while Eli can see and interact with other ghosts and possess objects in the ghost world. Collect information, solve puzzles, and unlock locations to unravel the mystery behind the culprit of Eli\u2019s murder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hit &amp; Haunted</strong> is a murder mystery investigation game, except you\u2019re not a detective. Instead, you play as two characters: <strong>Eli</strong>, the ghost of the victim; and <strong>Ace</strong>, the hitman who killed him. This unlikely duo must work together to find the anonymous client who hired the hit so that Eli can move on to the afterlife, and more importantly, <i>stop haunting Ace</i>. (This is made a bit more difficult by the fact that Eli doesn\u2019t remember much about his life, because, you know, Ace shot him in the head.)</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between Ace and Eli to use their different abilities. Ace is able to interact with other living humans and objects in the living world, while Eli can see and interact with other ghosts and possess objects in the ghost world. Collect information, solve puzzles, and unlock locations to unravel the mystery behind the culprit of Eli\u2019s murder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Hit &amp; Haunted is a top-down murder mystery game where a hitman is suddenly visited by an apparition of his most recent hit. Switch perspectives to take advantage of their unique mechanics and get to the bottom of this ghastly case.",
